323 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Sector\072 Airline\nLeadership \174 Coaching \174 DesignOps\n\nAir Canada aimed to release new end\055to\055end features while improving existing experiences to be more scalable and resilient\056 As design lead and coach for the Book\054 Shop\054 and Manage experiences\054 I led the delivery of new features while advising user research projects\056 I strengthened the design practice by developing key processes and standardizations that improved team efficiency\054 and led a coaching initiative with bi\055weekly sessions to professionally develop the designers on the team\056)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 324 0 R
     /Pg 311 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

