329 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Sector\072 Financial Services\057Banking\nLeadership \174 DesignOps \174 Prototyping\n\nRoyal Bank of Canada set out to build a cash management system from the ground up\056 As UX Design Lead and Strategist\054 I guided multiple key workstreams\054 designing complex experiences for both end users and developers\056 I led the development of service design blueprints for my workstream areas\054 contributed to building the design system\054 and implemented new scalable processes within the design practice\056 The resulting application\054 RBC Clear\054 went on to win eight awards after launch\054 including two for outstanding customer experience\056)
     /K [ 9 ]
     /P 330 0 R
     /Pg 311 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

