335 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Sector\072 Government\nLeadership \174 Design System \174 Prototyping\n\nThe Government of Canada developed an entirely digital passport renewal experience as application volumes increased year over year and impacted wait times at service centres\056 As design lead and AI specialist\054 I delivered the design system and designed the end\055to\055end renewal platform\054 including leading the design of the AI\055powered computer vision tool that evaluates passport photos in real time\056 The digital application enabled citizens to renew passports from home while reducing pressure on physical service centres\056)
     /K [ 12 ]
     /P 336 0 R
     /Pg 311 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

